  "uncertain_points": [],
  "security_implications": "key_init_q holds secret key material. If key_init_we is asserted at an improper time or key_init_d is corrupted, the key may be overwritten with incorrect data, potentially causing a key leak or failure of cryptographic operations. The reset condition zeroizes key_init_q, which is good for security. However, there is no integrity check on key_init_d before loading.",
